venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
.claude/
test_files/
__pycache__/
cache/
tracks/
# Tapped grids: user data, local-only. Unlike cache/, deleting this loses work
# that cannot be regenerated from the audio.
data/grids/

# Library manifests: per-account data now that the app is multi-tenant (used
# to be a handful of files for one person; now potentially every account's
# song titles/filenames). Was never gitignored before this project went
# multi-user — that was an oversight relative to data/grids/ above, not a
# deliberate choice, and the migration to data/library/<user_id>/ makes it
# one worth fixing now rather than carrying forward.
data/library/

# Accounts database (bcrypt hashes, emails) and its WAL-mode sidecar files —
# never committed, same as any other real user data above.
data/users.db
data/users.db-wal
data/users.db-shm

# Secrets and local overrides. .env.example (committed) documents the shape;
# .env itself is per-deploy and holds SESSION_SECRET among other things.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example